      "path": "SKILL.md"
    },
    {
      "kind": "instruction",
      "label": "**Pay attention to colors**:",
      "node_id": "node-e7d430d0eb4e8f469f0fb58c",
      "path": "SKILL.md"
    },
    {
      "kind": "instruction",
      "label": "Use vibrant, complementary colors",
      "node_id": "node-501ab3b44df99deefba78ce9",
      "path": "SKILL.md"
    },
    {
      "kind": "instruction",
      "label": "Add contrast (dark outlines on light shapes, light outlines on dark shapes)",
      "node_id": "node-a1b9e03d4267a1db0d60f659",
      "path": "SKILL.md"
    },
    {
      "kind": "instruction",
      "label": "Consider the overall composition",
      "node_id": "node-598ee0c31c4e7b8a4b8ad74a",
      "path": "SKILL.md"
    },
    {
      "kind": "instruction",
      "label": "**For complex shapes** (hearts, snowflakes, etc.):",
      "node_id": "node-670e9572d7a05a95cf755d7e",
      "path": "SKILL.md"
    },
    {
      "kind": "instruction",
      "label": "Use combinations of polygons and ellipses",
      "node_id": "node-b124687ba1944a09a5e58ca4",
      "path": "SKILL.md"
    },
    {
      "kind": "instruction",
      "label": "Calculate points carefully for symmetry",
      "node_id": "node-7eecb838d6ab48a59537c655",
      "path": "SKILL.md"
    },
    {
      "kind": "instruction",
      "label": "Add details (a heart can have a highlight curve, snowflakes have intricate branches)",
      "node_id": "node-cb7d4b33a0fc46c362ae75f4",
      "path": "SKILL.md"
    },
    {
      "kind": "instruction",
      "label": "Be creative and detailed! A good Slack GIF should look polished, not like placeholder graphics.",
      "node_id": "node-4f22bbb17e03622361afae2c",
      "path": "SKILL.md"
    },
    {
      "kind": "instruction",
      "label": "**Use thicker lines** - Always set `width=2` or higher for outlines and lines. Thin lines (width=1) look choppy and amat",
